00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:13.130
If so, why did it come out?

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.170
Could it be?

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:17.300
Is it like a fixed future that can't be 
changed no matter what you do?

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:21.930
You buy a lottery ticket despite 
already knowing that you won't win.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.310
Is there any value in knowing the future 
beforehand even if it can't be changed?

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.310
Knowing it beforehand?

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.480
I don't see the point.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:32.530
There's the bus!

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:38.450
Hey, Yun!

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.510
The meaning of seeing the future...

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.880
BB?

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:55.590
He's a specialist in Archetype research, 
and a passionate fan of Ashihara.

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:58.760
He reviewed your essay and sent that over.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.690
He's a... fan?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:02.760
This is...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.570
It's a schematic of Archetype.

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:09.330
A rotation in four dimensions brings 
about a reflection in three dimensions.

00:04:09.870 --> 00:04:10.860
That's it!

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:15.030
If the particles reach out to other 
dimensions as well, there's a new symmetry...

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:16.190
Which means?

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.780
We're only seeing a cross-section of Archetype.

00:04:20.450 --> 00:04:21.530
For example,

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:25.750
if this represents the space-time we're in,
 and the stick represents light,

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:29.040
even if space is distorted 
by the influence of higher dimensions,

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.250
we can't and won't realize a thing.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.050
Let's say the light goes straight through it.

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:37.550
That would mean the light has 
passed through the world twice.

00:04:37.550 --> 00:04:40.180
<i>This</i> is the refraction through time.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:44.680
That means Archetype is a material with a structure that reaches into higher dimensions.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:48.730
A material where half of it exists in another world?

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.690
Could Archetype have been 
made in another world after all?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:55.020
We call it the Singular Point.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:58.780
Could that Singular Point be in London!?

00:04:58.780 --> 00:04:59.740
Nope.

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:03.560
Well, I guess they do have <i>something</i> 
there you could call a Singular Point...

00:05:03.560 --> 00:05:04.490
This is your captain speaking.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:09.000
We have just received a call regarding 
an incident of unknown cause in the flight route.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:13.960
This plane has received instructions to 
temporarily land at Milan Malpensa Airport.

00:05:13.960 --> 00:05:15.750
We apologize for the inconvenience that...

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.510
One of the giant creatures among the 
swarm that appeared in Tokyo Bay

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.760
has made landfall in Tokyo.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:25.640
I think it's safe to say that monster's producing red dust.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:28.390
Is this according to Ashihara's prophecy as well?

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.980
He definitely did suggest their existence.

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:35.190
Who thought they'd all appear 
at the same time, though?

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:39.740
Now, is Salunga who's 
sealed beneath our feet the real deal,

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:41.780
or could it be our new friend who appeared in Tokyo?

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.530
What is the status on Salunga?

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:46.410
It seems to be pushing up from the inside.

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:50.500
At this pace, 24 hours is all we have left
before we reach the pressure limit.

00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:54.250
<i>Pushing up?</i> How is that even possible?

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:57.390
Sure, because it's controlling the red dust.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.630
We were able to provision the plastic foam in time.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:03.260
Is some cushioning enough 
to keep that thing locked up?

00:06:03.260 --> 00:06:05.340
In theory, it'll put up enough resistance.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:08.260
If we damage SHIVA, this would have all been for naught.

00:06:08.580 --> 00:06:10.140
In theory...?

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.890
If that fella can control red dust,

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:16.610
how about we try and do the same?

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:19.530
With the Orthogonal Diagonalizer.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:21.860
I'd like permission to use it.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:47.640
Red dust has all but fogged up the surroundings...

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:48.890
Radio disturbance has been observed.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.390
All activity in the capital has been halted.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:53.510
Due to the blackout, suspension of the train lines...

