00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:33.520
Fiercer?

00:07:33.520 --> 00:07:36.230
Some even say they are immortal.

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:40.860
If we think the Rodan's self-destruct in Nigashio was the result of their incompatibility with the environment,

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:45.520
then it's possible that the red dust may 
be broadening the habitat for all kaiju.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:49.240
A material that spreads nightmares...

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:53.830
Currently, all flights over the coast of Europe are prohibited.

00:07:53.830 --> 00:07:55.260
Looking out...

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.870
Continuing on from America's east coast,

00:07:57.870 --> 00:08:01.500
the flock of Rodan have now 
begun to appear across Europe.

00:07:58.470 --> 00:07:59.750
A red sea?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.470
"Kaiju, Kaju... Bringers of Calamity."

00:08:04.960 --> 00:08:08.630
Pero 2, show me the picture I took of the station front the day before the festival.

00:08:08.930 --> 00:08:10.190
This one?

00:08:11.140 --> 00:08:12.930
"The salt turns red..."

00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.140
"The salt turns red, and then bitter,"

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:17.480
"From thence cometh Funado's Beasts of the End."

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.400
"Even as the gods held sway 
in the ancient days, I have not heard

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.110
that water gleamed with Autumn red 
as it does in Nigashio."

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.030
m 780 164 l 794.67 146.67 1057.33 146.67 1073.33 160 1074.67 964 1065.33 976 800 977.33 784 960

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.030
m 780 164 l 794.67 146.67 1057.33 146.67 1073.33 160 1074.67 964 1065.33 976 800 977.33 784 960

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.030
<b>Kos</b>

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.030
Koshira

00:08:22.150 --> 00:08:24.030
Koshira

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:24.020
"Koshira."

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:26.030
What's that? A magic spell?

00:08:26.030 --> 00:08:28.530
It's more of a local legend.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:32.010
The Beasts of The End appear when the sea turns red.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:32.910
Or so it says.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.410
As it does in the Revelation.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.290
A third of the sea turns into blood, and the creature appears.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.670
It seems to me like a story 
that was written not so long ago...

