What?

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.640
Oh, right. I haven't told you yet.

00:08:52.180 --> 00:08:55.810
The diagram that BB sent you 
is a schematic of the red dust.

00:08:55.810 --> 00:08:58.230
The red dust is Archetype!?

00:08:58.230 --> 00:09:01.270
I thought <i>you</i> would have already realized it.

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.940
I was able to secure a rental car.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.530
So this is red dust...

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:08.240
We'll be able to continue our journey by land.

00:09:06.530 --> 00:09:12.070
If that's the case, that means Archetype has already spread across the whole world...

00:09:08.570 --> 00:09:11.400
On the bright side, our weekend trip just got longer.

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:20.460
Anyways, that bastard in Tokyo's 
gettin' crushed by Jet Jaguar!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.250
Just how do you plan on crushing it?

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.080
How nice of you to ask!

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.540
Haberu, take over.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.590
'Kay.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.420
Alley-oop.

00:09:30.010 --> 00:09:31.880
Anguirus' horn!?

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.180
Just when did you steal it?

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.850
You make it sound criminal.

00:09:35.850 --> 00:09:37.430
This is our loot!

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.520
It can ricochet bullets and even predict the future!

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.310
It's one hell of a horn!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:45.060
I don't think the horn was doing the predicting.

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.940
That's too early for us to say!

00:09:46.940 --> 00:09:50.950
If we turn this into a weapon for Jet Jaguar 
to wield, it'll be a hell of a fighter!

00:09:50.950 --> 00:09:52.450
Turn it into a weapon how?

00:09:52.450 --> 00:09:54.660
As an arrowhead fired by a bow!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.700
We're done for if we miss just once!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.330
Think of it like this. One shot, one kill.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.040
Hey, how about we turn it into a spear?

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.960
I see. A spear...

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:03.750
Ta-da!

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.210
Analysis of the song data is complete.

00:10:06.210 --> 00:10:10.710
The song includes a signal that has sixteen 8-bit blocks.

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.800
Sixteen 8-bit blocks?

00:10:12.800 --> 00:10:15.890
If we compare the song recorded at
 Misakioku to the original,

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.260
something akin to a signal was included.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.560
That's what I made Yung analyze.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.980
It was inside the song?

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:25.600
If we consider the sixteen blocks as individual groups,

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:29.010
there is a signal that rings only 
at the start of the 6th block.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.360
This sequence looks familiar...

00:10:31.360 --> 00:10:33.240
If we connect and convert them into decimals...

00:10:33.240 --> 00:10:37.950
The result is 05639160700302.

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:42.750
Reversed, it is 20300706193650.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.580
19:00, 6th July 2030...

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:50.250
That is approximately 37 minutes after 
the song was recorded in the mansion.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.960
Date and time?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.260
Can you process the other rows in a similar way?

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:57.010
I considered multiple possibilities,

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.760
but there were none that showed any meaning.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:04.440
Someone stored time as data in the song 
with the intention of communicating it to the Rodan?

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:07.150
I don't think Rodan would know the Gregorian calendar.

00:11:07.150 --> 00:11:10.130
Don't forget there were rumors about a song playing from the mansion way back.

00:11:10.570 --> 00:11:12.480
When did the song start playing?

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.780
The original song was recorded more than 60 years ago.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:17.050
Which means?

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.080
Are you okay?

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.630
It cut the metal wires!

00:11:23.750 --> 00:11:25.790
Jeez. The hell are you guys doing!?

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:30.340
Something has been hidden inside it...

00:11:40.180 --> 00:11:41.640
Seriously, what the hell is this thing?

00:11:54.070 --> 00:11:55.150
I knew it.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.150
That song came from <i>him... </i>

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.230
Who the hell put this here?

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.130
Sorry about that! You got some dirt on you.

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:21.890
How wonderful!

00:12:21.890 --> 00:12:24.950
A reaction like this after 80 years is simply wonderful...

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:32.020
Due to radio disturbance, 
network traffic has gotten rather heavy.

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:34.270
The situation is worse than I thought.

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:37.860
Even if we are to defeat the Rodan, 
we'll have to deal with the red dust.

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.570
It's like the kaiju and red dust are one and the same.

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:44.580
The red dust is Archetype, and you and 
your team are researching the red dust...

00:12:44.580 --> 00:12:46.000
What of it?

00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.250
Did you guys create the kaiju?

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:52.250
Do you really think we have the knowledge to create life?

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:55.340
It's said that Archetype has 13 phases,

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:59.350
and of those, we can handle only three of them.

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:03.970
Ashihara had predicted the appearance 
of the creatures based on the red dust.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:09.480
He discovered traces of red dust inside 
a particular jellyfish that he harvested in Japan.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:15.150
And that jellyfish was a totally different species 
that absorbed and used red dust in its body.

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:18.860
Both the red dust and the kaiju are abiogenetic?

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:22.820
Red dust was only found in certain places.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:25.240
Yet suddenly it's engulfing the world.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.240
We don't know the reason.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:30.710
Is there anything we can do about the red dust?

00:13:30.710 --> 00:13:32.500
There is one thing.

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:34.960
Archetype's 13th phase.

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:41.010
The Orthogonal Diagonalizer can work as a 
catalyst to convert Archetype into different phases.

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:42.800
I read that in the thesis.

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:45.260
Can we use it to detoxify the red dust?

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.560
For us, who have only reached the third phase,

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:50.640
the 13th phase is but a pie in the sky.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.940
Then...

00:13:51.940 --> 00:13:55.470
But that was only until your report came to light.

00:13:55.900 --> 00:13:59.650
BB is preparing a demonstration experiment as we speak.

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.210
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:06.790
