00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:28.890
Everyone, listen carefully!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:34.350
While you're suspended and sticking to the wall, 
you'll feel like your footing is unstable,

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.020
but let me give you a different perspective!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.620
Think as if your feet are planted on the ground!

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.150
Incoming!

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.080
