00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.300
Plan A has failed.

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.760
Unable to pinpoint its location.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:49.600
Should we close off the wall?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:51.180
