00:15:51.180 --> 00:15:57.640
When the gods and demons churned the ocean, 
what first floated up was a poison.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:01.360
When SHIVA had a taste of it, he turned blue.

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:03.610
Thank you for your patience.

00:16:03.610 --> 00:16:06.530
