00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:22.330
For all other areas beyond, 
it is best to prepare for the unexpected...

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:24.620
Alright! Lookin' good!

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:26.080
Proceed, very slowly.

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.350
Roger! Proceeding, very slowly.

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:33.820
Hey! Pull over!

00:20:34.800 --> 00:20:35.920
I have stopped.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:38.300
Done up pretty well, eh?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.680
Jet Jaguar can talk now!?

00:20:41.180 --> 00:20:43.180
I transferred Yung into Jet Jaguar.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:45.310
Then this is Yung?

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.310
Yung! How are you feeling?

00:20:47.310 --> 00:20:49.440
This is a new experience for me.

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.610
Yung. Let me give you a new name.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.570
Starting today, you are Jet Jaguar Yung!

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.310
My name is...

00:20:58.490 --> 00:20:59.570
Jet Jaguar!

00:20:59.570 --> 00:21:02.240
Jet Jaguar! Crush Habel underfoot!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.490
I cannot do that.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:04.830
Damn right you can't!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:07.540
Heh, the Three Laws of Robotics in this day and age?

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:10.830
Alright, Jet Jaguar! Now hold this!

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:11.910
Roger.

00:21:18.590 --> 00:21:22.590
I call it... the Spear of Anguirus!

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:24.850
What a cute robot it's become!

00:21:24.850 --> 00:21:25.970
That's cute?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:27.640
Now, a signature pose!

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:28.770
Alright!

00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:31.470
East, West, South, North! Heaven and Earth!

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.440
East, West, South, North! Heaven and Earth!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.070
That pose is kinda off.

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:42.450
Jet Jaguar. Switch to Protocol Spear!

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.570
Time for a warm-up.

00:21:43.570 --> 00:21:46.080
Roger. Setting protocol.

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:48.770
Beep, beep, beep...

00:21:56.170 --> 00:21:57.590
Lookin' good!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:05.100
The time hath cometh to eradicate Godzilla!

00:22:06.640 --> 00:22:12.390
<b>I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color</b>

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:18.270
<b>And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life</b>

00:22:18.270 --> 00:22:23.650
<b>If this feeling can grow naturally on its own</b>

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:29.530
<b>Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder?</b>

00:22:30.200 --> 00:22:34.160
<b>I don't know anything</b>

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:38.540
<b>Not even anything about you</b>

00:22:41.420 --> 00:22:47.050
<b>Let me keep on dreaming for now</b>

00:22:47.050 --> 00:22:51.430
<b>If this moment is all I have now</b>

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:55.890
<b>I can still feel the warmth in my palm</b>

00:22:57.730 --> 00:23:03.150
<b>My thrumming feelings open and burst out</b>

00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:07.160
<b>I want to keep learning more, like I am now</b>

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:13.700
<b>This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop</b>

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:14.660
<b>It won't stop</b>
